# Discovery scratch files. `candidates.json` is one run's search results and
# `_verified.json` is the inspection report for the same run; both are inputs to
# writing entries, not entries themselves, and they go stale the moment the
# search queries change. The entries they produce are what gets committed.
candidates.json
_verified.json
